<article class="article wrap"><header class="article-header"><a class="back-link" href="/writing/">← All writing</a><div class="eyebrow"><%= page.topic %> / <%= page.format_label || 'Technical article' %></div><h1><%= page.title %></h1><p class="article-deck"><%= page.summary %></p><div class="article-meta"><time datetime="<%= page.date.format('YYYY-MM-DD') %>"><%= date_label(page.date) %></time><span><%= reading_time(page) %> min read</span><span><%= page.lang==='en'?'English':'Chinese' %></span><span>z3vok<% if(page.archived) { %> · Archive<% } %></span></div></header><div class="article-layout"><div class="article-main"><% if(page.archived) { %><div class="archive-note"><span class="note-title">Archive note</span><p>Original dates and source attribution are preserved. Identifying details have been redacted; some lab endpoints and screenshots are withheld. Software versions and environments are historical.<% if (page.missing_images > 0) { %> <%= page.missing_images %> archived illustrations remain unavailable and are marked in place.<% } %><% if(page.recovered_images > 0) { %> Recovered <%= page.recovered_images %> illustrations from the local archive.<% } %></p></div><% } %><% if(page.content_status) { %><div class="archive-note"><span class="note-title"><%= page.content_status %></span><p>Prepared for review.<% if(page.source_checked) { %> Sources checked <%= String(page.source_checked).slice(0,10) %>.<% } %></p></div><% } %><div class="prose" id="article-body" lang="<%= page.lang || 'en' %>"><%- page.content %></div><div class="article-end"><span>End of article</span><a href="/writing/">Back to writing ↗</a></div><% const related=journal_posts().filter(p=>p.path!==page.path && p.topic===page.topic).slice(0,3); if(related.length){ %><section class="related"><div class="eyebrow">Related notes</div><h2>Read next</h2><% related.forEach(p=>{ %><a href="<%= p.path.startsWith('/') ? p.path : '/'+p.path %>"><%= p.title %><span>↗</span></a><% }); %></section><% } %></div><aside class="article-aside"><div class="toc-sticky"><div class="eyebrow">Contents</div><nav aria-label="Table of contents"><div lang="<%= page.lang || 'en' %>"><%- toc(page.content, {list_number:false, max_depth:3}) %></div></nav><a class="toc-top" href="#main">Back to top ↑</a></div></aside></div></article>
